                        "review": "This \"so called game\" should really stop to exist at this point. Redfox' management is absurdly cruel and have 0 understanding on what the community wants/needs.\n\nPeople with accounts of over 10+ years have been banned for \"abusing\" (which wasn't even abusing) a poorly designed event. \n\nIn this game it's possible to set the amount of rounds per game.. So to speed up progress, people just set the game rounds at 1 and went with it. And people got BANNED over this. While its clearly a mistake on the event designers for even allowing this nor communicating it. \n\nPeople have spend ALOT of money on this game.. And Redfox doesn't care. \n\nPlease, let this game die and don't give these tumors of developers any more cash.",
